Z||000009||Spektyr||04-19-2001||12:42 PM||||Yup, the article about the BMW and Mustang raises a good point.<P>If you're racing and the other guy bites it, you can go to jail for vehicular manslaughter.<P>Remember, it's nice to win, but I'll lose and stay out of jail anyday.<P>Decide before you hit the gas just how fast you want to take it.  If they still want to race beyond that, tap your brakes.  When that nose tips down a bit, they know you're done racing.<P>Sure, they might pass you, but anyone can pass a car that isn't racing.<P>(Incidentally, I've 'won' two races in my Lincoln Towncar by sacrificing my opponent to the local PD.  Race a little bit, back off and let them fly by the squad car.  I couldn't be racing him... I'm just in a Town Car.  I got where I was going first.  I win.)<P>hehe<p>[This message has been edited by Spektyr (edited 04-19-2001).]||||reg||1
